      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shorewood%2C_Wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Shorewood High School alumnus William Rehnquist, Class of 1941, became the U.S. Chief Justice.",
